B.fl=new A.bx(B.B1,["A duelist who fights alone by choice, at his most dangerous with no one left to protect.","Strikes before her target even registers the fight has started.","Reads the battlefield like a puzzle, and punishes anyone already bleeding.","Opens every engagement at full intensity and never eases off.","Lets the first blow land wrong, then makes the enemy regret ever swinging.","A wall that gets harder to break the more his team needs him to hold.","Turns every failed attack against her into the opening for her own.","Shrugs off the first real hit of any fight like it never happened.","Nothing narrows his aim. His shots always find as many targets as intended.","Steps between his allies and danger without waiting to be asked, once.","Finds the ally closest to falling and pours everything into keeping them up.","Layers curse over curse until the target can barely remember what normal feels like.","Draws in every kind of healing like a plant turning toward the sun.","Her presence alone keeps her team's resources flowing a little faster.","Wraps her allies' buffs in a ward that shrugs off whatever follows.","Sees the roll before it lands, and gets to try again if it doesn't.","Chains one strike into the next, each one hitting harder than the last.","The closer he gets to zero, the more dangerous he becomes.","Sometimes an attack against her simply finds nothing there.","Adapts mid-fight, sharpening whatever he leaned on last."],t.li)
