B.Zl=new A.aC([B.px,"Counter: the next single-target hit against you is reflected straight back at whoever threw it, at full effect. An area attack ignores it and leaves it standing.",B.py,"Counter: dodge the next single-target melee attack against you and answer it with a free counter-hit. Once per battle.",B.pA,"Counter: name a kind of power. The next attack of that kind against the warded ally is cancelled outright, and its attacker is Stunned for 2 turns.",B.pB,"Counter: a multi-hit burst against you only lands its first hit. Every later hit in the same burst is suppressed.",B.pC,"Counter: when a ranged attack hits you, that ability goes on double cooldown for its owner.",B.lD,"Counter: the next single-target attack on the protected ally is redirected onto one of the attacker's own squad at random. You are Exposed while it is armed.",B.lE,"Trap, laid on an enemy: the next time they use a damaging ability it is countered outright and they take the trap damage instead.",B.lF,"Mark, laid on an enemy: the next area attack they aim at your squad is nullified, and you borrow the ability for 2 turns.",B.lG,"Counter: while you are Guarded or Braced, damage you take is banked instead of lost. Your next attack deals all of it as bonus damage.",B.pz,"Counter: when your survive-lethal charge saves you, every status you are carrying lasts twice as long and whoever struck you is Stunned for 2 turns.",B.pD,"Pre-declared: the next time you would be reduced to 0 health, you are not. You stay standing on 1 health and act one more time, and are then gone for good. No body is left to recall, so your squad gets no Trion Salvage."],A.ad("aC<i_,l>"))
